 Creature — Elf Warrior', 'Legendary Creature — Giant Wizard', 'Legendary Creature — God', 'Legendary Creature — Human Berserker', 'Legendary Creature — Human Warrior', 'Legendary Creature — Human Wizard', 'Legendary Creature — Phyrexian Praetor', 'Legendary Creature — Serpent', 'Legendary Creature — Shapeshifter', 'Legendary Creature — Squirrel', 'Legendary Creature — Wolf', 'Legendary Enchantment', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Kaya', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Niko', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Tibalt', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Tyvar', 'Legendary Snow Artifact', 'Legendary Snow Creature — God', 'Legendary Snow Creature — Shapeshifter', 'Legendary Snow Creature — Troll Warrior', 'Legendary Snow Creature — Zombie Wizard', 'Snow Artifact', 'Snow Creature — Angel Wizard', 'Snow Creature — Bear Spirit', 'Snow Creature — Bird', 'Snow Creature — Elf Rogue', 'Snow Creature — Elf Warrior', 'Snow Creature — Giant Wizard', 'Snow Creature — Human Wizard', 'Snow Creature — Kraken', 'Snow Creature — Spirit', 'Snow Creature — Troll Warrior', 'Snow Creature — Yeti', 'Snow Creature — Zombie Berserker', 'Snow Creature — Zombie Cleric', 'Snow Enchantment — Aura', 'Snow Instant', 'Snow Land', 'Snow Land — Forest Island', 'Snow Land — Forest Plains', 'Snow Land — Island Mountain', 'Snow Land — Island Swamp', 'Snow Land — Mountain Forest', 'Snow Land — Mountain Plains', 'Snow Land — Plains Island', 'Snow Land — Plains Swamp', 'Snow Land — Swamp Forest', 'Snow Land — Swamp Mountain', 'Snow Sorcery', 'Sorcery']
